    <title>第6期：随心自在，在逸衡，找到健康好状态</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678efd4dc3617f02a42319da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678efd4dc3617f02a42319da</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jan 2025 01:56:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从citywalk、朋克养生、特种兵旅行到露营小野、公园20分钟效应，享受生活，已成为现代人的健康消费刚需，回归“松弛感”本质，享受身心愉悦的健康状态，看逸衡如何为你的旅途减轻身心倦怠.....</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期「洲游情报局」，我们邀请了逸衡酒店的嘉宾，带我们深度了解逸衡酒店品牌的独特魅力，解锁逸衡酒店隐藏玩法，gap一下，让生活更even！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jessica：洲际酒店集团旗下逸衡酒店品牌小伙伴</span></p><span></span><p><span>Betty： 洲际酒店集团旗下逸衡酒店品牌小伙伴</span></p><span></span><p><span>倪总： 洲际酒店集团旗下内容矩阵“洲游情报局”主理人</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a> 快节奏的生活下，如何保持健康生活状态，嘉宾私人小妙招独家分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> “随心自在，解锁健康好状态”-逸衡品牌理念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a> 从多维感官层面，助力宾客轻松解锁健康好状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> 客房健身角，纵享私领域健身体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> 都是干货！细数逸衡特色服务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a> 嚯！在金牛逸衡还能体验这些活动啊......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 夏日poolparty，清凉解暑好去处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> 深中通道开通，逸衡陪你解锁大湾区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> 冬季滑雪圣地&amp;夏季森林氧吧，崇礼逸衡还是太全面啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 新年展望：尽请期待更多逸衡酒店吧！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpsHUkiqPVR_vPFc9ngix39IDLSZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲成都金牛逸衡酒店：亲近自然的抵达体验</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpst8B0qkeyix0d24HiW5wRfGj41.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲成都金牛逸衡酒店：一应俱全的健身设施</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FugVViJ-nU5zn48bcex5tBed8dCP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲中山逸衡酒店：可使用动感单车给手机充电</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtodPp_0uwsEQk7PiIlPojC6PKm-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲中山逸衡酒店：无边泳池，随时可享Pool Party</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmIbqTKYXKX-ljikJa1WQap70Tvg.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲深圳南山逸衡酒店：客房内部的健身区域，足不出户也能运动</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnXfMA_0Fz6ij2EndS7sDSlwBSGd.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲深圳南山逸衡酒店：提供丰富的全麦早餐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjqZC--K5u-EoY8IsJsWyVf7gusR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲深圳光明天安云谷逸衡酒店：位于深圳市天安云谷技术园区</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkshPxwea8naNulr8VGSWAjnEjCV.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲深圳光明天安云谷逸衡酒店：活力水站提供健康饮品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhl_sdArgKFKjDL-GBmC2UKsj1um.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲崇礼逸衡酒店：两面环山，户外活动四季皆宜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvGBtDJ6pDt2Utg7Qpj7MGNvC-mE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲崇礼逸衡酒店：完善的健身设施</span></p><span></span><p><span>下次旅行目的地酒店？打开</span><a href="https://w.slinking.cn/l/?k=hCv&amp;sa_utm=D" data-url="https://w.slinking.cn/l/?k=hCv&amp;sa_utm=D"><span>洲际酒店集团IHG优悦会微信小程序</span></a><span> ，分分钟搞定！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在微信公众号搜索【洲游情报局】，了解更多目的地玩法，酒店测评和信息！</span></p>]]></description>
