    <title>第5期：为每一次出发充能！住智选，才能更全面！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6736ae3f43dc3a4387c1d750</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6736ae3f43dc3a4387c1d750</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Nov 2024 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近，智选假日酒店官宣了许昕作为品牌代言人。众所周知，许昕是一位国民度非常高的世界级乒乓球冠军，同时又是以全面著称，跟智选假日的气质非常契合。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是我们邀请到了智选假日酒店的小伙伴，来做客本期「洲游情报局」，带我们深入了解品牌的独特魅力。从代言人许昕到品牌全新升级，为差旅人提供优质睡眠、特色早餐、高效办公环境，以及智能科技服务。智选假日如何为每次出发充能？一起探寻品牌背后的故事～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Yvonne：洲际酒店集团旗下智选假日酒店 品牌小伙伴</span></p><span></span><p><span>小倪：洲际酒店集团旗下内容矩阵“洲游情报局” 主理人</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">1:32</a> 智选假日为何选许昕作为代言人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">2:55</a> 品牌升级的背后：年轻行动家，效率最大化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">4:07</a> 住过100多家智选假日的常旅客，最在乎什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">7:12</a> 早餐吃好：“智选有碗面”、现磨咖啡和现烤可颂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 日行3w步，也能快速充能的酒店“秘密武器”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 差旅人的办公痛点，都被狠狠戳中，又完美解决了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> 智能机器人送餐和自助洗衣服务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">19:56</a> 泡温泉、citywalk、看火箭：智选假日的多重玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a> 彩蛋：酒店优惠券和会员升级秘籍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fru1veaDUNP66X8mdp5i95XfC3CB.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲智选假日酒店品牌代言人 许昕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmHPPL7-hagZX5NE2peMAdgHEHvZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲智选假日早餐——“智选有碗面”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frq7OxDD1Kl06HWBd4Y13XpdsKM1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲智选假日早餐——现磨咖啡</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjXxgPt4hEbzlt1O9BS5RjYBqqpy.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲智选假日早餐——现烤可颂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhp5NshOL_Gr-s9hyW8qkXWgHmz1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲智选假日酒店软硬双枕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2tdJT_KYk4YHGGqpOI3uhn6vbD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲智选假日酒店充能手账（各酒店提供的服务有所不同，请以实际情况为准。）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjLDgOg3CTwFrpPvs5_liqf0LzSF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲智选假日酒店充能包（各酒店提供的服务有所不同，请以实际情况为准。）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkxQYUWF3-ARgqa2CMohefpvFdb2.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲智选假日酒店智能机器人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgFhAK0b8w46-y2DWqpCmGj4WEgY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲上海静安寺智选假日酒店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft9uRfkhpxZqjKVxp4Na-UaK1uML.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲上海静安寺智选假日酒店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FobZzZZy5mh34zSwu2AIWtsFT9OG.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲ 北京礼士智选假日酒店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FubnlJ1l4l81BzeawPMHorblOH6L.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲北京礼士智选假日酒店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl_Vk3jbja4_iiqx_JWPtt1LUO5l.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲文昌南洋美丽汇智选假日酒店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu1JwEHFP6ASnsJSRrioqL3uKP8P.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲文昌南洋美丽汇智选假日酒店</span></p><span></span><p><span>下次旅行目的地酒店？打开</span><a href="https://w.slinking.cn/l/?k=hCv&amp;sa_utm=D" data-url="https://w.slinking.cn/l/?k=hCv&amp;sa_utm=D"><span>洲际酒店集团IHG优悦会微信小程序</span></a><span> ，分分钟搞定！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在微信公众号搜索【洲游情报局】，了解更多目的地玩法，酒店测评和信息！</span></p>]]></description>
