    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️ 欢迎收听新一期的《洲游情报局》！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我们邀请到了洲际酒店集团的两位嘉宾，一起畅聊英迪格酒店独特的“邻间文化”，从广州到九寨沟，从苏州到迪庆，带你领略英迪格酒店的本土魅力和个性化体验。还有佘诗曼的趣味旅行故事，千万别错过！</span></p><span></span><p><span>关注我们，带你洲游全世界!</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jane 洲际酒店集团旗下英迪格酒店 品牌友友</span></p><span></span><p><span>小倪 洲际酒店集团旗下内容矩阵“洲游情报局” 主理人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场&amp; 嘉宾介绍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="118">01:58</a> 民宿 vs. 酒店：嘉宾分享住宿偏好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 英迪格的邻间文化初探</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 嘉宾分享九寨沟和迪庆英迪格的设计和特色</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a> 英迪格酒店的本地文化体验</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 嘉宾印象深刻的英迪格酒店：苏州古运河和广州海心沙</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 佘诗曼的品牌代言故事与微综艺《邻感七日》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1929">32:09</a> 国庆出游推荐：天目山英迪格、云南自驾路线</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 下期预告: IHG酒店会员积分攻略</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmF46BdbTm3eA8riFeJb3nP16MSR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲九寨英迪格酒店： 藏羌文化</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu_6svmzos0tfNBj-e311DsZ_l-B.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲迪庆月光城英迪格酒店：藏地文化</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtDb9SfKRlJPcw_R6nKoRXSwuOWV.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲苏州古运河英迪格酒店：古运河文化</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmfOPVdbl7U_tCkXxmtMoRBn7G-k.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲广州海心沙英迪格酒店：岭南文化</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnShBQGBeYmjvYW6P875dzTHaZGk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>▲杭州天目山英迪格酒店：自然与人文同生同荣的邻间文化</span></p><span></span><figure><img